<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνό-πεδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Opp.
			<u>C.</u>
			4.331
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with soil fit to
				produce wine, abounding in wine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ γουνὸν ἀλωῆς οἰνοπέδοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.193
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.193
			</span></i> ; <i>productive of wine,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πέδῃσι φυτηκομίῃσι μεμηλώς</span>
			Opp.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνό-πεδον</span></b> , τό, <i>vineyard,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμενος . . , τὸ μὲν ἥμισυ οἰνοπέδοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.579
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				892
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.604c
			</span></i>, prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκ-</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1000.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνο-πέδη</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.409
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Gaet.
			</span></i>).</div>
